{"id":"fd49e6f1efcceae4","group":"93","path":"93/93-ex-abelian-group.md","title":"Abelian Group","display":"Abelian Group","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ex-abelian-group","aliases":["93-ex-abelian-group"],"display":"Abelian Group","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-abelian]]","[[93-df-commutator]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-group]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ex-abelian-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ex-abelian-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Abelian Group"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e2be868cf664b716\" href=\"?note=e2be868cf664b716\" title=\"93-df-abelian\">93-df-abelian</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb9dce8251e2dc37\" href=\"?note=eb9dce8251e2dc37\" title=\"93-df-group\">93-df-group</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"ex-abelian-group---Abelian-Group\">ex-abelian-group - Abelian Group</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> are the sourced group and abelian-group predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eb9dce8251e2dc37\" href=\"?note=eb9dce8251e2dc37\" title=\"93-df-group\">93-df-group</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbAlg}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\)</span> is the abelian-algebra class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e2be868cf664b716\" href=\"?note=e2be868cf664b716\" title=\"93-df-abelian\">93-df-abelian</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}\">\\([\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[(\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg})\n\\land(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\leftrightarrow\n[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A})\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[(\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg})\n\\land(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\leftrightarrow\n[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A})\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>For groups, the universal-algebra commutator of the total congruence with itself is diagonal exactly when multiplication is commutative. Abelian groups are precisely the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>-modules.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-abelian-group---Abelian-Group","text":"ex-abelian-group - Abelian Group","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-abelian","status":"resolved","id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-abelian]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"eb9dce8251e2dc37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"eb9dce8251e2dc37","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf A)$ and $\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf A)$ are the sourced group and abelian-group predicates of [[93-df-group]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-abelian","status":"resolved","id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is the abelian-algebra class of [[93-df-abelian]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)$ and $[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}$ are as in [[93-df-commutator]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbAlg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[(\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg})\n\\land(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\leftrightarrow\n[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A})\\Bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false}],"bytes":1225,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e2be868cf664b716","18ca772ab524a46f","6730349967b8ffce","eb9dce8251e2dc37"]}